<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Prepium | Smart Exam Mastery</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --brand: #0062ff;
            --brand-soft: #eef4ff;
            --success: #00c853;
            --text-dark: #0a0c10;
            --text-muted: #5f6672;
            --surface: #ffffff;
            --bg-light: #f4f7fa;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        /* The "Mobile-App" Frame */
        .app-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 430px; /* iPhone Pro Max width */
            background: var(--surface);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
        }

        .hero {
            padding: 4rem 2rem 3rem;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--brand-soft) 0%, #ffffff 100%);
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;
            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;
        }

        .logo-box {
            background: var(--brand);
            color: white;
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 98, 255, 0.2);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin: 0;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            color: var(--brand);
        }

        .tagline {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-top: 10px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .features-grid {
            padding: 2rem;
            display: grid;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--surface);
            padding: 1.2rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #edf2f7;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--brand);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .card-icon {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            height: 50px;
            width: 50px;
            background: var(--bg-light);
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .card-info h3 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .card-info p {
            margin: 4px 0 0;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .actions {
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-top: auto;
            background: white;
            position: sticky;
            bottom: 0;
        }

        .btn {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 1.1rem;
            border-radius: 18px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--brand);
            color: white;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 98, 255, 0.25);
        }

        .btn-primary:active { transform: scale(0.96); }

        .btn-outline {
            color: var(--brand);
            background: var(--brand-soft);
        }

        .stats-bar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            padding: 1rem;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--success);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="app-container">
        <header class="hero">
            <div class="logo-box">P</div>
            <h1>Prepium</h1>
            <p class="tagline">The ultimate CBT practice engine for ambitious students.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="stats-bar">
            <span>● Live Questions</span>
            <span>● Instant Results</span>
        </div>

        <section class="features-grid">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon">⚡</div>
                <div class="card-info">
                    <h3>Fast-Track Learning</h3>
                    <p>Clean, distraction-free interface.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon">🎯</div>
                <div class="card-info">
                    <h3>Mixed Subjects</h3>
                    <p>Combine multiple topics into one test.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon">🛡️</div>
                <div class="card-info">
                    <h3>Exam Mode</h3>
                    <p>Simulate real conditions with a timer.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="actions">
            <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-primary">Create Account</a>
            <a href="/login" class="btn btn-outline">Sign In</a>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>